---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Special Needs Support | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's inclusive environment and specialized support for children with special needs.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Special needs support" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Special Needs Support</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Inclusive environment with specialized support and individualized attention for children with special needs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Special Needs Support at Marietta Childcare</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides inclusive, specialized support for children with special needs. Marietta Childcare's commitment to inclusion ensures all children feel valued and supported.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Inclusive Environment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare creates an inclusive environment for children with special needs. Inclusion at Marietta Childcare means all children learn and play together. Marietta Childcare's inclusive approach celebrates differences and promotes acceptance.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's environment is designed to accommodate diverse learning and physical needs. Inclusive programming at Marietta Childcare supports children's participation in all activities. Marietta Childcare's commitment to inclusion benefits all children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Individualized Support Plans</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare develops individualized support plans for children with special needs. Support plans at Marietta Childcare address each child's unique needs and goals. Marietta Childcare's plans are developed collaboratively with families and specialists.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's individualized approach ensures appropriate accommodations and modifications. Support plans at Marietta Childcare are reviewed regularly and adjusted as needed. Marietta Childcare's commitment to individualization supports each child's success.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Specialized Care and Attention</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides specialized care for children with special needs. Specialized attention at Marietta Childcare includes individualized instruction and support. Marietta Childcare's staff is trained in supporting diverse learning and developmental needs.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's specialized approach ensures children with special needs receive appropriate care. Care at Marietta Childcare includes modifications to activities and environments. Marietta Childcare's specialized support promotes children's growth and development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Staff Training and Expertise</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff receives training in supporting children with special needs. Staff training at Marietta Childcare includes special needs inclusion and differentiated instruction. Marietta Childcare's educators have expertise in various special needs areas.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff is trained in positive behavior support and adaptive strategies. Training at Marietta Childcare includes communication techniques and sensory strategies. Marietta Childcare's expertise supports children with diverse needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Collaboration with Specialists</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare collaborates with specialists supporting children with special needs. Specialist collaboration at Marietta Childcare includes speech therapists, occupational therapists, and developmental specialists. Marietta Childcare's partnerships ensure comprehensive support.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare coordinates services and shares information with specialists. Collaboration at Marietta Childcare ensures consistency between home and school services. Marietta Childcare's integrated approach supports children's overall development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Family Partnership and Communication</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains strong partnerships with families of children with special needs. Family communication at Marietta Childcare includes frequent updates and progress reports. Marietta Childcare's staff works collaboratively with families on support goals.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare values family input and expertise about their child. Partnership at Marietta Childcare includes regular conferences and goal-setting meetings. Marietta Childcare's collaborative approach ensures families are active participants in their child's care.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Accessible Facilities and Accommodations</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's facility includes accommodations for children with physical disabilities. Accessible facilities at Marietta Childcare support children's participation in all activities. Marietta Childcare's environment is designed with accessibility in mind.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides adaptive equipment and materials as needed. Accommodations at Marietta Childcare are individualized based on each child's needs. Marietta Childcare's accessible approach ensures all children can participate fully.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Advocacy and Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare advocates for children with special needs. Advocacy at Marietta Childcare includes supporting families in accessing services and resources. Marietta Childcare's staff helps families navigate special needs services and systems.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides emotional support to families of children with special needs. Support at Marietta Childcare extends beyond childcare to family well-being. Marietta Childcare's commitment to families includes advocacy and resource connection.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">We Welcome All Children</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare is committed to supporting children with special needs and their families. Contact Marietta Childcare to discuss how Marietta Childcare can provide specialized support for your child.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/teacher-qualifications" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Teacher Qualifications?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
